OL,3,GNEWSAUK treatment resumes for Jersey
OL,4,Acataracts patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FCataract patients in Jersey are once
OL,7,Fagain being sent to the UK for
OL,8,Ftreatment in a bid to cut waiting
OL,9,Flists.
OL,11,FJersey's government had hoped to
OL,12,Fprovide the service on-island, but its
OL,13,Frecruitment process is ongoing.
OL,15,FIt comes after patients told BBC Jersey
OL,16,Fthey had been waiting years for an
OL,17,Foperation.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
