OL,3,GNEWSAUK treatment resumes for Jersey
OL,4,Acataracts patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth Minister Tom Binet said
OL,7,Fproviding treatment in Jersey "would be
OL,8,Fpreferable" but that sending patients
OL,9,Fto Southampton was "necessary in the
OL,10,Fmeantime".
